AWK:

TERMS USED IN AWK:

NR: No. of record/row
NF: No of fields
$0 : Print Eveything
$1,$2: Field no 1, Field no 2

Example: To find 4th column form a data with n columns:
awk '{print $4}' filename
*** If you want to print last column then instead of putting $number, put NF and the result will be same
Example: awk '{print $NF}' filename
